        "title": "打: measure compatible referents",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "Classifier 打 is pronounced dá and means a dozen. It differs from dǎ meaning hit.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "我买了一打鸡蛋。",
                "pinyin": "wǒ mǎi le yī dá jīdàn 。",
                "meaning": "I bought a dozen eggs.",
                "audio": "81dfc9e12e01429794f12c8d8ce5da47de952ccf34e2e4658f9d903f41574444"
              },
              {
                "text": "两打是二十四个。",
                "pinyin": "liǎng dá shì èr shí sì gè 。",
                "meaning": "Two dozen is twenty-four.",
                "audio": "5a16a2dc17b9c114554692e3e5c5d60761887ab7e6acf57697f4de5ada6244cc"
